{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-037",
    "title": "最后一盏引路灯"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_233",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "慧闻将无相铜镜递给顾长离：“你现在不能修行，但可以替它记录。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "归墟盟总坛的石门只撑了半刻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6694,
          "end": 6694
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青光从门缝中渗入，先覆盖石阶，再爬上墙壁。墙上悬挂的旧盟约一张张鼓起，像纸下有手在推动。归墟盟主将黑色水池掀翻，池水化作一道墨墙，暂时挡住光潮。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6696,
          "end": 6696
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总坛不能再留。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6698,
          "end": 6698
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“去哪里？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6700,
          "end": 6700
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主指向石厅尽头：“天门之下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6702,
          "end": 6702
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看见那里原本是一面石墙。墙面被青光照过后，浮出一扇向下的门，门上没有锁，只有三枚凹槽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6704,
          "end": 6704
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“残印、铜环、无相镜。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6706,
          "end": 6706
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离将铜环放进第二个凹槽，慧闻把无相铜镜放进第三个。陆照临把融合后的灰白圆盘按入第一个凹槽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6708,
          "end": 6708
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石门向下开启。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6710,
          "end": 6710
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "阶梯一直延伸到地底，四周没有灯，却有无数名字从石壁里透出微光。每走一步，便有一个名字在耳边轻声念出，声音来自不同年龄、不同地域的人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6712,
          "end": 6712
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临听见一个陌生女孩说：“我叫许秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6714,
          "end": 6714
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "又听见一个老人说：“我叫沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6716,
          "end": 6716
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "再往下，是顾氏旁支一串被削掉的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6718,
          "end": 6718
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里保存的是所有被放弃的名字？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6720,
          "end": 6720
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是保存。”慧闻说，“是等待归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6722,
          "end": 6722
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向归墟盟主：“你早知道？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6724,
          "end": 6724
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道总坛下面有门，不知道门后是名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6726,
          "end": 6726
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "阶梯尽头是一片巨大的地下空洞。空洞中央悬着一座倒置的城，城墙向下，街道向上，所有屋舍都由灰白色石片拼成。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6728,
          "end": 6728
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是回川城？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6730,
          "end": 6730
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三百年前的回川城。”慧闻答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6732,
          "end": 6732
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城门上方没有匾额，只有一道尚未闭合的裂缝。裂缝与天门天空中的裂缝完全相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6734,
          "end": 6734
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧灾不是从灵脉城开始。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6736,
          "end": 6736
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“也不是从天门开始。”陆照临补充。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6738,
          "end": 6738
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主走到倒置城下，抬手触碰一块石片。石片立即显现出一段影像：三百年前，北境各州灵脉同时逆流，山川倒悬，凡人失去昨日，修士失去姓名。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6740,
          "end": 6740
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "可它没有足够的力量。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6742,
          "end": 6742
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "于是它把一座城、一群人的记忆和三方经手人的真名填进裂口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6744,
          "end": 6744
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“失败了。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6746,
          "end": 6746
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么还能维持三百年？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6748,
          "end": 6748
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为失败的修补仍然比破裂好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6750,
          "end": 6750
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看着倒置城中数不清的灯：“所以那些人一直被困在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6752,
          "end": 6752
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们不是被困。”归墟盟主说，“他们是支撑世界的材料。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6754,
          "end": 6754
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离向前一步：“材料也有名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6756,
          "end": 6756
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "倒置城内忽然响起钟声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6758,
          "end": 6758
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一座石楼从城墙上脱落，落入空洞底部。石楼碎裂后，露出里面密密麻麻的灯芯。每根灯芯上都刻着一个姓名。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6760,
          "end": 6760
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看到一根灯芯上的字：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6762,
          "end": 6762
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6764,
          "end": 6764
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他冲向倒置城门。城门却在他靠近前闭合，门缝中传来陆沉舟的声音：“这里不是我的家。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6766,
          "end": 6766
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你为什么不出来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6768,
          "end": 6768
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为有人要留在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6770,
          "end": 6770
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6772,
          "end": 6772
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所有还没有被记住的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6774,
          "end": 6774
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临按住门面，金丹中的青色纹路立刻暴涨。门内灯芯同时点燃，倒置城的街道变成一片火海。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6776,
          "end": 6776
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻抬起无相镜：“别打开。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6778,
          "end": 6778
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我能把他们带回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6780,
          "end": 6780
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你只能把一部分带回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6782,
          "end": 6782
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一部分也好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6784,
          "end": 6784
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那剩下的呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6786,
          "end": 6786
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6788,
          "end": 6788
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到他身边，将铜环贴在城门上。铜环内侧浮出一行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6790,
          "end": 6790
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏经手人，第三次点灯未完成。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6792,
          "end": 6792
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-101",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6894,
          "end": 6894
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她最后一缕灵气从体内散尽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-086",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7074,
          "end": 7074
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "但天门下方，最后一盏引路灯已经照亮了回人间的路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-087",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7076,
          "end": 7076
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离醒来时，已经在地底通道的出口。她先看自己的手，再看腕上的铜环。铜环内侧的字迹没有变化，灵气也没有重新回来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-088",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7078,
          "end": 7078
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还好吗？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-089",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7080,
          "end": 7080
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“能走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7082,
          "end": 7082
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还能感觉到灵气吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-091",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7084,
          "end": 7084
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“像隔着一扇门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7086,
          "end": 7086
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“要不要后悔？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7088,
          "end": 7088
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向身后的灯海：“后悔也不能把灯芯拔出来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-094",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7090,
          "end": 7090
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把她放下，转身望向通道：“有人来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-095",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7092,
          "end": 7092
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处传来玄霄宗的脚步声，夹杂着归墟盟的铜铃。三方都在寻找最后一盏灯，而灯火已经照到了天门裂缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-096",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7094,
          "end": 7094
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻将无相铜镜递给顾长离：“你现在不能修行，但可以替它记录。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7096,
          "end": 7096
        }
      }
    ],
